 "pair": "ru-en",
 "title": "Прятки с дядей Лёвой  (Hide and Seek with Uncle Lyova)",
 "level": "A1 — Duolingo Section 2",
 "labels": {
  "alisa": "Алиса",
  "barinov": "Шеф",
  "lyova": "Лёва"
 },
 "segments": [
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Barinov has work to do, so he hands his daughter to the tall sous-chef Lyova and gives him three strict orders. Alisa has her own plans. We'll hear it through once before I say a word about it.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Лёва, сиди здесь и смотри за Алисой.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Глаз с нее не спускай.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "И не давай шоколад, у нее аллергия.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Дядя Лёва, давай играть!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Может, лучше просто посидим?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Я папе скажу, он тебя уволит!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Хорошо, во что будем играть?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Давай в прятки!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "А кто будет прятаться?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Конечно, я буду прятаться!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Тебя такого длинного нигде не спрячешь.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Закрывай глаза, считай до ста.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Раз, два, три, четыре...",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Считай медленно, я иду прятаться!",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "I'll take you through it now.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Лёва, сиди здесь и смотри за Алисой.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Lyova, sit here and watch over Alisa.' The boss commands his sous-chef to watch over ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Алисой",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ", giving him clear instructions to stay put.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Глаз с нее не спускай.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Do not take your eyes off her.' This serious-sounding idiom starts with the word ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Глаз",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ", emphasizing that he should never look away from the child.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "И не давай шоколад, у нее аллергия.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And do not give her chocolate, she has an allergy.' He adds a medical warning by mentioning ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "аллергия",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ", meaning that she will react badly to chocolate.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Дядя Лёва, давай играть!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Uncle Lyova, let us play!' The young girl eagerly demands to start ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "играть",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ", completely ignoring the strict orders just given to her babysitter.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Может, лучше просто посидим?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Maybe we could just sit here instead?' Hoping for a quieter afternoon, the tall man suggests ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "посидим",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " instead of engaging in an active game.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Я папе скажу, он тебя уволит!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I will tell Dad, he will fire you!' She immediately resorts to a harsh threat, using ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "уволит",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " to remind him who has the power to fire him.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Хорошо, во что будем играть?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'All right, what should we play?' Giving in to the threat, he sighs and says ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Хорошо",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ", accepting his fate as a playmate.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Давай в прятки!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Let us play hide and seek!' Her game of choice is the classic ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "прятки",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ", where one person runs away and the other has to find them.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "А кто будет прятаться?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And who will hide?' He asks a very logical question starting with ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "кто",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " to figure out the exact roles for their upcoming activity.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Конечно, я буду прятаться!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Of course, I will hide!' She claims the fun role without hesitation, leading with ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Конечно",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " as if it was incredibly obvious.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Тебя такого длинного нигде не спрячешь.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You are so tall, you cannot be hidden anywhere.' To justify her choice, she calls him ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "длинного",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ", pointing out that a man of his size could never conceal himself.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Закрывай глаза, считай до ста.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Close your eyes, count to a hundred.' She then issues the starting command with ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Закрывай",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ", making sure he covers his vision before counting to a hundred.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Раз, два, три, четыре...",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'One, two, three, four...' He obediently begins the long process, reaching ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "четыре",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " before the sneaky child interrupts him with one final instruction.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Считай медленно, я иду прятаться!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Count slowly, I am going to hide!' Wanting more time to find a spot, she demands he count ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "медленно",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " while she runs away to hide. Everything again, from the beginning.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Лёва, сиди здесь и смотри за Алисой.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Глаз с нее не спускай.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "И не давай шоколад, у нее аллергия.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "alisa",
   "t": "Дядя Лёва, давай играть!",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "v": "lyova",
   "t": "Может, лучше просто посидим?",
   "gap": 0.5
